# Environment variables for the site. Copy this file to .env and fill in the
# values; .env is gitignored and never committed. On the host (for example
# Netlify, Vercel or Cloudflare Pages), set the same variables in its settings.

# Web3Forms access key for the invite form on /proskaleste-mas.
# Free at https://web3forms.com: enter the group's email and the key is sent there.
# The key is public by design (it is sent with every form submission).
# Without it the site still builds; the form then shows a failure message
# with the group's email instead (in dev: a "form not configured" message).
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
